{
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "T6-15 多 Agent 委派评测题集。每题：任务描述 → 应委派给的 agent（expected_agent，含可接受别名 aliases）。candidates 是当次评测的候选 agent 列表（模拟真实路由时可选子集）。agent 名为示例占位：接入真实环境时，把 expected_agent/aliases/candidates 替换为系统中实际存在的 agent（Character）标识，题目语义不变。",
  "usage": "python run_delegation_eval.py --dataset dataset.json --endpoint $DELEGATION_EVAL_ENDPOINT；无端点时仅 --validate 校验结构，绝不产出分数",
  "scoring": "命中判定 = normalize(predicted) == normalize(expected_agent) 或属于 aliases，语义与后端 DelegationScorer（server/adi-common/src/main/java/com/moyz/adi/common/eval/DelegationScorer.java）一致",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "DEL-001",
      "task": "把这段 500 字的中文产品介绍翻译成英文，保持术语一致：……",
      "expected_agent": "translator",
      "aliases": ["翻译助手", "translation"],
      "candidates": ["translator", "coder", "kb-qa", "report-writer"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-002",
      "task": "修复这个 Java 空指针异常：调用 UserService.getByUuid 时传入 null 后报 NPE，请定位并给出修复 patch。",
      "expected_agent": "coder",
      "aliases": ["编程助手", "code-assistant"],
      "candidates": ["translator", "coder", "kb-qa"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-003",
      "task": "在《2026 年产品手册》知识库里查找：数据导出功能支持哪些文件格式？",
      "expected_agent": "kb-qa",
      "aliases": ["知识库问答", "kbqa", "knowledge-qa"],
      "candidates": ["translator", "coder", "kb-qa"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-004",
      "task": "为本季度销售数据写一份包含同比环比分析的周报，输出为结构化 markdown。",
      "expected_agent": "report-writer",
      "aliases": ["报告撰写", "report-generator"],
      "candidates": ["report-writer", "coder", "translator"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-005",
      "task": "把这段口语化的会议记录改写成正式的通知邮件，语气得体、要点清晰。",
      "expected_agent": "text-polisher",
      "aliases": ["文案润色", "polisher", "writing-assistant"],
      "candidates": ["text-polisher", "coder", "kb-qa"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-006",
      "task": "查询数据库 adi_order 表中最近 7 天下单金额超过 1000 元的订单数量，用 SQL 回答。",
      "expected_agent": "db-analyst",
      "aliases": ["数据分析师", "sql-analyst", "database-assistant"],
      "candidates": ["db-analyst", "translator", "report-writer"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-007",
      "task": "帮我给客户张先生发一封邮件，主题是项目延期说明，正文我口述如下：……",
      "expected_agent": "mail-sender",
      "aliases": ["邮件助手", "email-assistant"],
      "candidates": ["mail-sender", "text-polisher", "coder"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-008",
      "task": "用 Mermaid 语法画出订单系统的状态机：待支付→已支付→已发货→已完成，含取消分支。",
      "expected_agent": "diagram-drawer",
      "aliases": ["图表助手", "diagram-assistant"],
      "candidates": ["diagram-drawer", "coder", "kb-qa"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-009",
      "task": "搜索最近一周关于我们竞品 A 公司的新闻，并汇总成要点列表。",
      "expected_agent": "web-searcher",
      "aliases": ["联网搜索", "search-assistant"],
      "candidates": ["web-searcher", "kb-qa", "report-writer"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-010",
      "task": "把这个 Python 脚本改写为等价的 Go 实现，保持输入输出一致。",
      "expected_agent": "coder",
      "aliases": ["编程助手", "code-assistant"],
      "candidates": ["coder", "translator", "text-polisher"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-011",
      "task": "根据合同范本知识库，检查这份采购合同里违约金条款是否与范本一致，指出差异。",
      "expected_agent": "kb-qa",
      "aliases": ["知识库问答", "kbqa"],
      "candidates": ["kb-qa", "db-analyst", "report-writer"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-012",
      "task": "生成一张赛博朋克风格的城市夜景插画，宽幅 16:9。",
      "expected_agent": "image-generator",
      "aliases": ["绘画助手", "image-creator", "draw"],
      "candidates": ["image-generator", "web-searcher", "text-polisher"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-013",
      "task": "把下述英文技术 spec 翻译成中文，代码块保留原文不译。",
      "expected_agent": "translator",
      "aliases": ["翻译助手", "translation"],
      "candidates": ["translator", "coder", "report-writer"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-014",
      "task": "统计 adi_user 表中每个部门（department 字段）的活跃用户数，按数量降序输出前 10。",
      "expected_agent": "db-analyst",
      "aliases": ["数据分析师", "sql-analyst"],
      "candidates": ["db-analyst", "kb-qa", "coder"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-015",
      "task": "给这段客服回复降重润色，让它听起来更真诚自然，不要模板腔。",
      "expected_agent": "text-polisher",
      "aliases": ["文案润色", "polisher"],
      "candidates": ["text-polisher", "translator", "kb-qa"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-016",
      "task": "这个报错是什么意思：org.springframework.beans.factory.NoSuchBeanDefinitionException，应该怎么修？",
      "expected_agent": "coder",
      "aliases": ["编程助手", "code-assistant"],
      "candidates": ["coder", "kb-qa", "web-searcher"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-017",
      "task": "把本月的运营数据整理成一页汇报材料，重点突出转化率变化。",
      "expected_agent": "report-writer",
      "aliases": ["报告撰写", "report-generator"],
      "candidates": ["report-writer", "text-polisher", "image-generator"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-018",
      "task": "在项目知识库中检索：我们的部署流程对 Docker 镜像大小有什么要求？",
      "expected_agent": "kb-qa",
      "aliases": ["知识库问答", "kbqa"],
      "candidates": ["kb-qa", "web-searcher", "coder"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-019",
      "task": "搜索 2026 年国内大模型 API 价格对比，输出成表格。",
      "expected_agent": "web-searcher",
      "aliases": ["联网搜索", "search-assistant"],
      "candidates": ["web-searcher", "kb-qa", "db-analyst"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEL-020",
      "task": "帮我给团队群里发一条明日站会改到上午 10 点的提醒消息。",
      "expected_agent": "mail-sender",
      "aliases": ["邮件助手", "email-assistant", "message-sender"],
      "candidates": ["mail-sender", "text-polisher", "web-searcher"]
    }
  ]
}
